1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 16=

8
00:00:46,859 --> 00:00:47,859
Insolent!

9
00:00:47,859 --> 00:00:49,679
Someone! Kill him!

10
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:04,459
Ergou, you are favored by fortune now,

11
00:01:04,739 --> 00:01:05,939
no longer who you used to be.

12
00:01:06,239 --> 00:01:08,239
Today, as your brother,
I grant you the power

13
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:09,700
to take revenge yourself.

14
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:22,939
Die!

15
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:25,760
Wh... What kind of sorcery is this?

16
00:01:25,959 --> 00:01:27,019
How are you this strong?

17
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Die!

18
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,019
I am a court official.

19
00:01:41,019 --> 00:01:42,560
You... You dare kill me?

20
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,099
Die?

21
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,739
That's too easy on the two of you.

22
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,040
Dear,

23
00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:51,140
it's all my fault.

24
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,480
He forced me!

25
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:55,500
I'll do anything to repay you.

26
00:01:56,099 --> 00:01:57,099
Dear...

27
00:02:00,060 --> 00:02:03,239
Only one of you gets to live today.

28
00:02:03,799 --> 00:02:04,799
Next,

29
00:02:06,019 --> 00:02:07,180
figure it out yourselves.

30
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:10,139
Fine! I'll kill
this shameless woman right now!

31
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,800
Let's go.

32
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:32,099
Our journey lies
in the vast mortal realm

33
00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:34,280
and across this boundless land.

34
00:02:56,259 --> 00:02:57,259
Watch closely.

35
00:03:03,659 --> 00:03:05,659
Dong, what are you doing?

36
00:03:06,419 --> 00:03:07,699
I'm heading to the capital soon.

37
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:09,759
Today, I'll catch a fish for you

38
00:03:10,139 --> 00:03:11,139
to nourish your bodies.

39
00:03:11,340 --> 00:03:12,340
Catch a fish?

40
00:03:12,939 --> 00:03:14,719
You can see
right to the bottom of this vat.

41
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:15,860
There are no fish here.

42
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,560
Dong just loves teasing people.

43
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:21,580
Hanyan, you actually took him seriously.

44
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,759
I...

45
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:26,360
Then do you dare make a bet?

46
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,199
- No.
- Boring.

47
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:34,300
Fairy, do you dare make a bet with me?

48
00:03:35,259 --> 00:03:36,979
Why not? You're on.

49
00:03:36,979 --> 00:03:37,979
What are the stakes?

50
00:03:38,599 --> 00:03:39,719
If I catch a fish,

51
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:41,340
I'll promote you.

52
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,560
Promote me?

53
00:03:43,219 --> 00:03:44,500
I'm at the Nascent Soul stage.

54
00:03:44,819 --> 00:03:47,120
A promotion would make me
Divine Transformation!

55
00:03:49,139 --> 00:03:50,139
Keep dreaming.

56
00:03:50,580 --> 00:03:52,379
I mean promoting you from a regular maid

57
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:54,360
to a bedchamber maid.

58
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:55,860
- No way!
- No way!

59
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,840
Ladies,

60
00:03:58,860 --> 00:04:00,460
you can't decide for me.

61
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,120
I accept the bet.

62
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,259
If you catch a fish,

63
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,800
I can be your bedchamber maid.

64
00:04:06,379 --> 00:04:08,259
But if you fail...

65
00:04:09,259 --> 00:04:10,259
Then what?

66
00:04:10,259 --> 00:04:12,300
- I'll still be your bedchamber maid.
- You...

67
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:13,520
As the Zixia Sect Holy Maiden,

68
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:15,219
it isn't too much, right?

69
00:04:15,919 --> 00:04:16,919
That's ambitious.

70
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:20,100
You two should learn from her.
Watch closely.

71
00:04:25,819 --> 00:04:29,420
I doubt Dong can conjure a fish
out of thin air.

72
00:04:32,939 --> 00:04:34,420
(Not a trace of spiritual energy.)

73
00:04:34,699 --> 00:04:36,019
(Seems he won't catch anything.)

74
00:04:36,019 --> 00:04:37,959
(Either way,)

75
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:39,899
(I'm getting promoted today.)

76
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:43,060
It's been so long,
and nothing has happened.

77
00:04:43,819 --> 00:04:46,420
Dong, I think
you're just putting on a show.

78
00:04:46,420 --> 00:04:47,420
Don't rush.

79
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:50,139
It's quite far away. Almost there.

80
00:04:50,459 --> 00:04:51,459
Watch this.

81
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:58,439
A big one took the bait.

82
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,199
You're talking nonsense.

83
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:03,000
The line hasn't even budged.

84
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,600
What big fish?

85
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:07,199
Exactly. There's no spiritual energy.

86
00:05:07,620 --> 00:05:08,620
Watch closely.

87
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:14,480
Three, two, one.

88
00:05:31,420 --> 00:05:32,420
Well...

89
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:38,220
Am I seeing things?

90
00:05:38,699 --> 00:05:40,060
I just saw a dragon!

91
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,000
It just got right here.

92
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,000
Me too.

93
00:05:43,060 --> 00:05:45,579
But he actually caught a fish.

94
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:48,100
You're amazing, Dong!

95
00:05:48,660 --> 00:05:49,740
Piece of cake.

96
00:05:51,019 --> 00:05:53,180
(Th... That's a true dragon!)

97
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:57,000
(Rumor has it only supreme beings
can fish across myriad realms.)

98
00:05:57,819 --> 00:06:00,019
(Just how much power is he hiding?)

99
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,120
What are you staring at?

100
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:13,040
Heat the pot and cook the fish.

101
00:06:17,660 --> 00:06:20,560
A lowly mortal daring to touch me?

102
00:06:20,759 --> 00:06:22,759
I shall tear you to shreds!

103
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:27,319
Master, its pressure is overwhelming.

104
00:06:27,939 --> 00:06:29,339
I can't even get close.

105
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,800
Relax. If I say it's fine, it's fine.

106
00:06:51,139 --> 00:06:52,139
(He's incredible.)

107
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:56,800
(Tonight, no matter what,
I'll be his bedchamber maid.)

108
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:59,579
Oh, right. Don't fry it.

109
00:06:59,699 --> 00:07:01,079
Chop it up and make soup instead.

110
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:06,519
That works. I love fish soup.

111
00:07:06,779 --> 00:07:07,779
Let's go.

112
00:07:11,796 --> 00:07:15,880
♪The cocoon of love shatters like snow♪

113
00:07:17,589 --> 00:07:22,399
♪Unable to sever
greed, wrath, and desire♪

114
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,399
Dong,

115
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:26,819
why can we only drink the soup
and not eat the meat?

116
00:07:27,339 --> 00:07:28,339
Remember.

117
00:07:28,339 --> 00:07:30,759
Only drink the soup, not eat the meat.

118
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:36,839
Smells so good.

119
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:49,459
Dong,

120
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:52,279
I feel like

121
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:55,879
I've entered paradise.

122
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:01,240
I was just about to tell you

123
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:03,300
to drink the soup slowly.

124
00:08:05,170 --> 00:08:09,950
♪A dying lamp, a shattered view♪

125
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:15,295
♪Barely escaped,
yet trapped in love's trial again♪

126
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:19,972
♪Entangled forever,
through life and death♪

127
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:22,980
Dong,

128
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:25,220
my body feels so warm and relaxed,

129
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,620
like a stove.

130
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:32,840
It feels like my body has been elevated.

131
00:08:34,710 --> 00:08:39,189
♪The cocoon of love shatters like snow♪

132
00:08:40,639 --> 00:08:42,940
(Every part of this true dragon
is precious medicine.)

133
00:08:45,814 --> 00:08:52,306
♪Where letting go
reveals moonlit streams♪

134
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:56,620
Master,

135
00:08:56,620 --> 00:08:58,919
I... I'm going to burst.

136
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,860
I was going to promote you
to bedchamber maid tonight.

137
00:09:11,139 --> 00:09:12,559
You couldn't handle it.

138
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:29,000
I'm heading to the capital soon.

139
00:09:30,179 --> 00:09:31,700
When I return,

140
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:33,580
I'll revive you with magic.

141
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:36,840
You are my first wife in this lifetime.

142
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:40,840
You hold a special place in my heart.

143
00:09:42,938 --> 00:09:45,404
♪A thousand dreams, still unsolved♪

144
00:09:45,755 --> 00:09:47,353
♪Mournful echoes♪

145
00:09:47,353 --> 00:09:51,195
♪Cannot save one bound by obsession♪

146
00:10:06,527 --> 00:10:10,118
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

147
00:10:10,118 --> 00:10:12,905
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

148
00:10:13,481 --> 00:10:15,643
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

149
00:10:15,643 --> 00:10:18,489
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

150
00:10:18,489 --> 00:10:21,767
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

151
00:10:21,767 --> 00:10:23,401
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

152
00:10:23,401 --> 00:10:25,465
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

153
00:10:25,465 --> 00:10:27,001
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

154
00:10:27,001 --> 00:10:29,783
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

155
00:10:30,232 --> 00:10:32,137
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

156
00:10:32,137 --> 00:10:38,168
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

157
00:10:38,750 --> 00:10:42,633
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

158
00:10:42,633 --> 00:10:45,858
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

159
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:48,969
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

160
00:10:48,969 --> 00:10:54,097
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

161
00:10:54,097 --> 00:10:57,625
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

162
00:10:57,625 --> 00:11:01,333
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

163
00:11:01,333 --> 00:11:03,225
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

164
00:11:03,225 --> 00:11:05,302
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

165
00:11:05,302 --> 00:11:07,833
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

166
00:11:07,833 --> 00:11:11,870
♪You met the most precious person♪

167
00:11:13,538 --> 00:11:15,401
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

168
00:11:15,401 --> 00:11:17,920
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

169
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:19,369
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

170
00:11:19,369 --> 00:11:21,671
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

171
00:11:21,671 --> 00:11:23,641
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

172
00:11:23,641 --> 00:11:28,051
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

173
00:11:28,051 --> 00:11:29,593
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

174
00:11:29,593 --> 00:11:31,503
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

175
00:11:31,503 --> 00:11:34,777
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

176
00:11:34,777 --> 00:11:38,098
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

177
00:11:38,098 --> 00:11:39,833
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

178
00:11:39,833 --> 00:11:44,457
♪Just catch your breath first♪

179
00:11:44,457 --> 00:11:48,207
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

180
00:11:48,207 --> 00:11:51,585
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

181
00:11:51,959 --> 00:11:53,929
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

182
00:11:53,929 --> 00:11:59,676
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

183
00:11:59,676 --> 00:12:03,192
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

184
00:12:03,192 --> 00:12:04,761
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

185
00:12:04,761 --> 00:12:07,071
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

186
00:12:07,071 --> 00:12:08,809
♪From laughter to devotion♪

187
00:12:08,809 --> 00:12:10,865
♪From falling to innocence♪

188
00:12:10,865 --> 00:12:12,713
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

189
00:12:12,713 --> 00:12:19,383
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
